# SYNTAX TEST "text.html.tiddlywiki5.memetic-wikitext" "A mem fence reads the dialect"
# A fence labelled mem names the memetic dialect. The base reads its content as wikitext, and the
# dialect's own injection supplies the sigils wherever the dialect stands — so in a .mem file the
# fence carries both.
```mem
A sigil <<~ flow >> and a macro <<amacro>>.
#       ^^ punctuation.definition.sigil.begin.memetic-wikitext
#         ^ keyword.control.sharktooth.memetic-wikitext
#           ^^^^ entity.name.function.sigil.memetic-wikitext
#                                 ^^^^^^ variable.name.macro.tiddlywiki5
```
